<title>LATVIA: Trading sluggish in Latvian bourse.</title>
<headline>Trading sluggish in Latvian bourse.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Volume fell during a sluggish day of trading at Latvia's infant bourse on Thursday, dealers said.</p>
<p>Overall market volume was just 58,679 lats, down from over 100,000 lats on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Market leader Unibank led the way as usual with over 20,000 lats worth of its shares changing hands and its price fell by 1.86 percent to 2.11 lats.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +3717-22 66 93</p>
